---
const facts = [
  { label: 'Registered as', value: 'Yuktibyte Products Private Limited' },
  { label: 'CIN', value: 'U62099KA2025PTC196482' },
  { label: 'Based in', value: 'Bangalore, India' },
];
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-border bg-navy-800/30 px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 lg:px-14 lg:py-14">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gold-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Who is behind this</p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-cream leading-tight mb-6">
            A named company,<br />
            <em class="font-semibold not-italic">on the record</em>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Margin asks you to upload the record of your portfolio, so it is fair to want to know
            who is receiving it. We are a company registered in India with our identification
            number published on this site, and the terms you sign up under are written out rather
            than summarised.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Margin is not an advisory service and is not registered as one. It makes no
            recommendations, sells no tips and takes no view on any stock. Every assumption behind
            a number it shows you is one you entered.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-8">
          <dl class="space-y-4">
            {facts.map((fact) => (
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-1 sm:gap-4 border-b border-border/60 pb-4">
                <dt class="text-xs text-muted tracking-widest uppercase sm:w-28 shrink-0">{fact.label}</dt>
                <dd class="text-sm text-cream">{fact.value}</dd>
              </div>
            ))}
          </dl>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3">
            <a href="/company" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors group">
              About the company
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/terms" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors">
              Terms of use
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
